# GitHub's linguist counts every tracked file toward the repository's language bar, which made
# research/ dominate it: 195 files of vendored third-party Vue and TypeScript against 26 files of
# this project's own Rust. Marking it vendored leaves the files in place, keeps their licences and
# the attribution chain intact, and stops them being reported as this project's code.
#
# research/ is not ours and is not built. It is reference source vendored while porting the
# keyboard protocol, and crates/wh-proto's module docs cite research/proto/ specifically as the
# origin of the ported files. See THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md.
research/** linguist-vendored
